WEBVTT

00:07:59.391 --> 00:08:01.268
LS: Whoo is right.

00:08:01.268 --> 00:08:02.937
To put that into perspective,

00:08:02.978 --> 00:08:05.689
that is shooting two
to three episodes a day

00:08:05.731 --> 00:08:08.442
versus the network standard of one a day,

00:08:08.442 --> 00:08:10.152
maybe two on Thursday.

00:08:10.819 --> 00:08:15.074
We did it all with a writing staff
of about half a dozen writers

00:08:15.074 --> 00:08:17.993
versus the network standard
that's about double that.

00:08:19.620 --> 00:08:22.957
Words cannot explain
to you how exhausting,

00:08:22.998 --> 00:08:26.001
emotionally and spiritually
challenging that was.

00:08:27.002 --> 00:08:28.796
And I started to feel like,

00:08:28.837 --> 00:08:31.006
"Hm, I think this chair's
a little wobbly."